# Wordsearch Localization & Extraction

This program analyzes a word search image, detects the grid and wordlist, 
and extracts every individual letter into separate image files for the OCR step

## Directory Structure

* Source Code: `localization/` (You are here)
* Input Images: `localization/test_images/` (Put your puzzle images here)
* Output Data: `../data/` (Results appear here)

---

## How to Run 

Follow these steps exactly for each new image you want to process.

### 1. Prepare your Image
Place your binqriwed word search image (PNG format recommended) 
inside the `test_images/` folder.

### 2. Clean Previous Run (IMPORTANT)
This deletes the old extracted letters from the `data/` folder 
so you don't mix up different puzzles.

### 3. Compile (type make)

### 4. Execute
./wordsearch_extractor test_images/image_name.png
with image_name.png the binarized image you want to extract letter from
